# CITATION.cff for the datazoom.social R package.
# Enables GitHub's "Cite this repository" button. Keep in sync with
# DESCRIPTION when the version or authors change.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use datazoom.social in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "datazoom.social: Simplify Access to Brazilian Social Data"
abstract: >-
  R package to download and process microdata from the PNAD Contínua
  (Continuous National Household Sample Survey, IBGE), with panel
  identification algorithms that link households and individuals across
  survey waves.
